Sval: the extensions menu lists pinned extensions

Firefox lists an extension with a toolbar button only while its button sits
in the menu, so a pinned extension leaves the menu and its controls, Pin to
Toolbar among them. SvalExtensionsMenu gives it a row in the menu's list
that names its button, and the row's menu pins and unpins by that name.
The button opens the menu even when every extension is pinned, where
Firefox would open the extensions list in its add-ons page instead.

